          "text": "How do I mine in this place?",
          "steps": [
            {
              "player": "How do I mine in this place?"
            },
            {
              "npc": "Okay, first you need dynamite. That's got three ingredients..."
            },
            {
              "type": "message",
              "text": "Firstly, you need volcanic sulphur. It comes from Toothy's mine, west of here.",
              "id": "vxJQVC"
            },
            {
              "type": "message",
              "text": "Secondly, you need juniper charcoal. Smoggy's got some charcoal furnaces on the beach in the Hosidius area, near the juniper woods.",
              "id": "JkhQuU"
            },
            {
              "type": "message",
              "text": "Thirdly, you need saltpetre. There are some natural deposits in the Hosidius woodlands, near the juniper trees.",
              "id": "dWd88B"
            },
            {
              "type": "message",
              "text": "Mix the volcanic sulphur, the juniper charcoal and the saltpetre in a pot to make dynamite. Finally add a string as a fuse.",
              "id": "KoJ0mW"
            },
            {
              "npc": "Once you've got dynamite, use a chisel to excavate a cavity in the hard rock walls, so you can put the dynamite in, then light the fuse."
            },
            {
              "npc": "The dynamite blows ore out of the hard rock. It's very unstable, so you don't have long to get it cleaned before it disintegrates."
            },
            {
              "npc": "Just deposit it into the sack upstream, and my colleague will get it cleaned safely. You can collect your cleaned ore from me."
            },
